@startuml
title Training Run - Detail

skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor Maintainer
participant "scripts.finetune" as CLI
database "Package" as Package
participant Tokenizer
participant "Unsloth + TRL" as Trainer
database "Training artifacts" as Artifacts

Maintainer -> CLI : explicit versioned config
CLI -> Package : preflight paths + external row checks
CLI -> Tokenizer : render chat once + append EOS
Tokenizer --> CLI : bounded training text
CLI -> Trainer : response-only LoRA SFT
Trainer -> Package : train + validation
Trainer -> Artifacts : checkpoints + adapter
Trainer -> Artifacts : GGUF export
CLI -> Artifacts : manifest after export succeeds

@enduml
